[
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Once you've installed Ableton Live, you must authorize the software, either online or offline. If you purchased Live through a third-party reseller, you must first register the serial number. If you encounter issues when authorizing, follow the steps in our guide to troubleshooting authorization.",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "ONLINE-B001",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Authorizing Live online",
    "body_html_line": 2,
    "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B002",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Authorizing online allows Live to connect directly to the Ableton server and authorize automatically. To use this method, on the computer where Live is installed, you need internet access and a web browser. We recommend Google Chrome or Mozilla Firefox.",
    "body_html_line": 3,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B003",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "1. Launch the Live application. You'll see the following authorization dialog:",
    "body_html_line": 4,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B004",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "2. Click Authorize with ableton.com. This automatically opens ableton.com in your browser.",
    "body_html_line": 6,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B005",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "3. Log in to your Ableton user account (if not already logged in).",
    "body_html_line": 7,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B006",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "4. Using the dropdown menu, select your Live license.",
    "body_html_line": 8,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B007",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: If your license contains an upgrade, only the highest version included in your license will be shown in the dropdown menu. Select this even if you wish to authorize a previous version. For example, if your license includes both Live 11 and Live 12, the dropdown menu will display Live 12.To see the earlier Live versions associated with a license that has been upgraded, choose the relevant license from the dropdown menu and click View serial numbers.If you need to authorize an older version of Live not included in your license, for example if installing Live on an older computer, contact Support for available options.",
    "body_html_line": 9,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B008",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "5. Click Authorize. This switches the focus back to Live.",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B009",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "6. Once Live has been authorized successfully, you'll receive confirmation. Click OK.",
    "body_html_line": 11,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live online",
        "body_html_line": 2,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXK4T2QB07W1NQJJG85"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B010",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Authorizing Live Offline",
    "body_html_line": 13,
    "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKPD7KCQ1N3XD8RN08",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live Offline",
        "body_html_line": 13,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKPD7KCQ1N3XD8RN08"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B011",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "If your computer doesn't have an internet connection, or if you've upgraded to Live 10 and are trying to authorize Live 9, see our guide to authorizing Live offline.",
    "body_html_line": 14,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Authorizing Live Offline",
        "body_html_line": 13,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKPD7KCQ1N3XD8RN08"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B012",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Troubleshooting",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKKZT5023RNVRQNG96",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Troubleshooting",
        "body_html_line": 15,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKKZT5023RNVRQNG96"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B013",
    "source_id": "HELP-AUTH-ONLINE-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "If you encounter issues when authorizing, check our guide to troubleshooting authorization issues.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Troubleshooting",
        "body_html_line": 15,
        "anchor": "h_01HETW7TXKKZT5023RNVRQNG96"
      }
    ],
    "id": "ONLINE-B014",
